# A dies trigger looks back in time (CR 603.10a): it triggers on the creature as it last existed on the battlefield. Bot1's
# first Doomed Traveler dies to Bot2's Lightning Bolt on turn 2, before Humility, with its "When this creature dies, create
# a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying": the Spirit is made (the control). The second one, cast under Humility on
# turn 3 and bolted on turn 4, had no abilities as it died, so nothing triggers: one Spirit only, itself a 1/1 without
# flying under Humility.

